<div class="section">
  <h1 class="title">Password Reset Request</h1>

  <div class="letter">
    <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
    <p>We received a request to reset your KCF account password. Click the button below to choose a new one. This link expires in 1 hour.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cta-wrap">
    <a href="{{resetUrl}}" class="cta">Reset Your Password</a>
  </div>

  <p class="fallback-link">Or copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>{{resetUrl}}</p>

  <div class="letter">
    <p>If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email — your password will not be changed.</p>
  </div>

  <p class="signoff">
    Thank you,<br>
    <span class="team">The Kwizera Team</span>
  </p>
</div>
